Third-party data bundled in this repository
===========================================

data/GeoLite2-Country.mmdb
--------------------------
This product includes GeoLite2 data created by MaxMind, available from
https://www.maxmind.com.

The GeoLite2 Country database is redistributed here so the application can
resolve a hosting country locally, with no API key, no rate limit and no
outbound call to a geolocation service. It is read through the `geoip2` Python
library in mri/geo.py.

Use of the GeoLite2 database is subject to MaxMind's GeoLite2 End User License
Agreement: https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite2/eula

To refresh the file, download a current GeoLite2-Country.mmdb from MaxMind
(a free account is required for direct downloads) and replace data/GeoLite2-Country.mmdb.
The application reads whatever build date is in the file and reports it at
/api/v1/health.
